  "translation": "Today my friend and I went to the supermarket together. We first went to the fruit section. There were many apples and bananas. How many apples do we need? We need five apples. My friend likes bananas very much, so she bought three bananas. The vegetable section is behind the fruit section. We saw tomatoes and carrots. My friend thought the tomatoes were really fresh, so she bought three, and I also bought some carrots. Later we went to the drink section. I wanted to buy a cup of water, but there was also milk, and the milk was on the right side of the drink section. I will choose milk, and my friend will choose water. We paid the money, then came out of the supermarket. We all happily went home."
